# The shell-command rewrite (issue #552) reads the same cue sets the native
# handler reads from data/meta/cue-lexicon.lino (`shell_infinite_loop`,
# `shell_screen_execution`), plus the command heads and prose leads its
# command detector weighs, so the browser twin answers from seed data.
